	(text "Stage 2 of 5: control bit 1 (weight 2).\nOutbound pole 1: COM=OIN_i, NC->OOUT_i, NO->OOUT_(i+2 mod 26).\nReturn pole 2:   COM=RIN_i, NC->ROUT_i, NO->ROUT_(i-2 mod 26).\nCTRL = 24 V stage drive, GND = 0 V. Coil pin 1 = +, pin 12 = - (verify polarity)."
